{"meta":{"title":"LIANG CHENGHAO'S","subtitle":"","description":"让博客回归原始","author":"LIANG CHENGHAO","url":"https://www.bonjourcs.com","root":"/"},"pages":[],"posts":[{"title":"记录人生","slug":"记录人生","date":"2024-11-29T16:17:13.000Z","updated":"2024-12-06T00:49:59.398Z","comments":true,"path":"2024/11/29/记录人生/","permalink":"https://www.bonjourcs.com/2024/11/29/%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F/","excerpt":"","text":"我曾经看过一个 TED 演讲，演讲者通过不断记录自己身体的各项指标，更清晰地认识自我。而且这些指标在就医建议、个人自信心的建立中起了非常重要的作用。 这个演讲给我了一种启发——可以通过离散的数字观察我们自身。比如，如果我想观察一段时间内我的身材变化。","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"随笔","slug":"随笔","permalink":"https://www.bonjourcs.com/tags/%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94/"}]},{"title":"Life Refs","slug":"yii","date":"2021-09-09T13:47:23.000Z","updated":"2024-12-06T00:49:59.398Z","comments":true,"path":"2021/09/09/yii/","permalink":"https://www.bonjourcs.com/2021/09/09/yii/","excerpt":"","text":"我思，故我在。 🚀 「做」比「想」重要。2022-2-25 🎉 现在醒来，还不算晚。2024-11-27","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"YII","slug":"YII","permalink":"https://www.bonjourcs.com/tags/YII/"}]}],"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"随笔","slug":"随笔","permalink":"https://www.bonjourcs.com/tags/%E9%9A%8F%E7%AC%94/"},{"name":"YII","slug":"YII","permalink":"https://www.bonjourcs.com/tags/YII/"}]}